  <conditions attached="1">
   <condition type="1">
    <narrative xml:lang="EN">Consistent with the Article III of the SBAA [or the Supplemental Provisions to the Project Document], the responsibility for the safety and security of the Implementing Partner and its personnel and property, and of UNDP&#x2019;s property in the Implementing Partner&#x2019;s custody, rests with the Implementing Partner.  To this end, the Implementing Partner shall: a)	put in place an appropriate security plan and maintain the security plan, taking into account the security situation in the country where the project is being carried; b)	assume all risks and liabilities related to the Implementing Partner&#x2019;s security, and the full implementation of the security plan.</narrative>
   </condition>
   <condition type="1">
    <narrative xml:lang="EN">Social and environmental sustainability will be enhanced through application of the UNDP Social and Environmental Standards (http://www.undp.org/ses) and related Accountability Mechanism (http://www.undp.org/secu-srm).</narrative>
   </condition>
  </conditions>
  <result aggregation-status="1" type="1">
   <title>
    <narrative xml:lang="EN">Annual Output Results</narrative>
   </title>
   <indicator ascending="0" measure="5">
    <title>
     <narrative xml:lang="EN">Output Indicator</narrative>
    </title>
    <description>
     <narrative xml:lang="EN">- Number of updated strategic plans of GC governorates developed.
- Number of urban studies and urban plans of the new administrative center and the financial and business centers prepared.
- GC urban restructuring study has been prepared.
- Number of reports and development plans for the Pyramids Plateaus and its surrounding prepared.
- Report and plan for upgrading at least one of the historical and heritage areas in Al- Fustat area prepared.
- Case studies, assessment reports, institutional/legal and governance studies prepared.</narrative>
    </description>
    <baseline year="2016">
     <comment>
      <narrative xml:lang="EN">- The strategic plans for Cairo, Giza and Qalioubiya need updating and are not finalized.
- New administrative boundaries for some governorates are being developed.
- Reports and structural maps of the service areas, recreational areas and open spaces at the level of GC.
- Reports of development plans for the GR urban areas that will be affected by regional projects.
- The urban development plan of the Pyramids Plateau area and its surrounding area has been initiated and ongoing.
- GOPP developed the future vision of the Fustat area and its leading projects were agreed upon by key stakeholders.
- Weakness of the institutional and legal framework and the governance system used for the urban management of Greater Cairo and the capital city.
- - Gender-related issues are not currently considered in urban planning studies.
- No training has been conducted on gender issues in urban planning.</narrative>
     </comment>
    </baseline>
    <period>
     <period-start iso-date="2020-01-01"></period-start>
     <period-end iso-date="2020-12-31"></period-end>
     <target>
      <comment>
       <narrative xml:lang="EN">-Develop Projects as per the outputs of the Urban Restructuring Study
-Prepare development plans for Giza Pyramids Plateau and Surroundings
-Develop and implement public engagement plan
-Develop National and international publications 
-Conduct National conference and seminars 
-Participate in international conferences and events
-Prepare studies on the impact of one of the proposed priority projects on gender &amp; how to observe this element among other project activities
-Conduct training courses on strategic planning, regulating land uses and urban administration, GIS/LIS</narrative>
      </comment>
     </target>
     <actual>
      <comment>
       <narrative xml:lang="EN">- A mid-term evaluation of the project was prepared by an independent consultant. July 2020.
- Urban Development Plan for Cairo City developed.
- Strategic Plan for Giza City developed.
- Updating of strategic plans for cities &amp; villages of Banha Center.
- Future Development plans for the area of Virgin Mary Church, Al-Zeitoun finalized.
- Developing strategic plans for Al-Shoair Island AlQanater -Qaliuobya Governorate.
- Development of 3D movie &amp; perspective shots of Al-Shoair Island
- Preparation of the development urban plan for the area surrounding the Pyramids plateau.
- Land use plan for both sides of Ibrahim Al-Orabi Axis (emergency canal) &amp; the land acquired finalized.
- Development plan for the southern entrance of Giza and Al-Moneeb Square.
- A facebook page for GOPP was established and used as a social Media platform for the project .
- Two training workshops were conducted entitled (Urban communication &amp; branding) and (Branding &amp; Media Communication (15 Nov &amp; 3 Dec 2020) for GOPP/Project staff, (10 trainees, 60% females).</narrative>
      </comment>
     </actual>
    </period>
    <period>
     <period-start iso-date="2021-01-01"></period-start>
     <period-end iso-date="2021-12-31"></period-end>
     <target>
      <comment>
       <narrative xml:lang="EN">- Finalize the master and detailed plan for the southern entrance of Giza and Al-Moneeb Square and pilot area
- Contineu the development of the development urban plan for the area surrounding the Pyramids plateau &amp; Grand Egyptian Museum to encompass a real estate appraisal.
- Continue the development of the of Al-Shoair Island AlQanater - Qaliuobya Governorate plan.
- Initiate the development plan of Leprosy colony in Abu Zaabal &#x2013; Qalyubia Governorate
- Produce a branded book for the project.
- Develop a documentation report on the different projects studies and design a booklet documenting the work of the project</narrative>
      </comment>
     </target>
     <actual>
      <comment>
       <narrative xml:lang="EN">- Master and detailed plan for the southern entrance of Giza and Al-Moneeb Square and pilot area developed
- Development of the urban plan for the area surrounding the Pyramids plateau and Grand Egyptian Museum and Real Estate Appraisa is in place.
- Developing of Al-Shoair Island AlQanater - Qaliuobya Governorate is in place.
- Finalization of the development plan for the Leprosy colony in Abu Zaabal &#x2013; Qalyubia Governorate
- Branded book prepared for the project.
- Preparing the Documentation report of projects studies and design of Project Documentation Booklet is in progress.</narrative>
      </comment>
     </actual>
    </period>
    <period>
     <period-start iso-date="2022-01-01"></period-start>
     <period-end iso-date="2022-12-31"></period-end>
     <target>
      <comment>
       <narrative xml:lang="EN">- Develop an Urban vision for Al- Fustat area and Cairo necropolis.
- Developing and upgrading the plan for the southern entrance of Giza (Al-Munib)
- Preparing phase II for Development Leprosy colony in Al-Khanka district - Qalyubia governorate
- Conduct training courses on urban planning law, applied cases, and urban communication and branding</narrative>
      </comment>
     </target>
     <actual>
      <comment>
       <narrative xml:lang="EN">-Urban vision for Al- Fustat area and Cairo necropolis was developed.
-Master and detailed plan for the southern entrance of Giza and Al-Moneeb Square and pilot area was prepared.
-Development and infrastructure plan of Leprosy colony in Al- Khanka District was developed.
- A two-days training workshop on urban planning law and applied cases took place
- One day training workshop been conducted on Urban Communication and Branding for 16 trainees (12 females, 4 Males) from all GOPP departments .</narrative>
      </comment>
     </actual>
    </period>
   </indicator>
