    <period>
     <period-start iso-date="2023-01-01"></period-start>
     <period-end iso-date="2023-12-31"></period-end>
     <target>
      <comment>
       <narrative xml:lang="EN">In 2023, first phase of updating the development plan for Al-Dahab Island has been finalized, and second phase is initiated, and the  development plan for area surrounding Bashteel railways station (Giza Governorate) is initiated. Additionally, in relation to preparing  an integrated development plan for Al-amal city(previously known as Ezbet El Haggana), the first and second phases are finalized. 
Furthermore, the detailed plan for the southern entrance of Giza and Al-Moneeb square, divided into three phases for completion, is finalized, and three main phases are completed. In 2023, in regards to updating the strategic master plan for rural settlements in Qalyubia governorate,  divided into three phases for completion, first phase is finalized and second phase is initiated.</narrative>
      </comment>
     </target>
     <actual>
      <comment>
       <narrative xml:lang="EN">In 2023,  the first phase of updating the development plan for Al-Dahab Island has been finalized and second phase is initiated and under progress. The first phase for the development for the area surround Bashteel railways station (Giza governorate) is completed and the second phase is initiated and in progress. 
A detailed plan for the southern entrance of Giza and Al-Moneeb Square is finalized. The preparation of an integrated planning for the development of Al-amal city (Previously known as Ezbet El Haggana) is finalized, which entailed developing the proposed development vision, proposing development alternatives and selecting the best alternative to develop Al-amal city development plan.
Regarding the update of the strategic master plan for rural settlements in Qalyubia governorate, divided into three phases for completion, the first and second phases were finalized and the third phase is initiated and in progress.</narrative>
      </comment>
     </actual>
